nge, Dead Zone, the kni","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T15:39:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067933775","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:34:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4971900-1845383656386684","game_id":"steam-4971900","kind":"update","title":"Chess Army: Blood & Death Update","summary":"Chess Army: Blood & Death UpdateFights now hit harder. Every kill has its own death animation, blood stays on the battlefield, and combat sounds have been reworked.BloodEvery hit sprays blood. The harder the hit, the further it flies.Blood stays on the ground for the whole fight and builds up blow after blow.Blood that lands in water drifts away with the current.Blood that hits a wall runs down it and pools at its base.New BLOOD option in Options and in the pause menu. Turn it off for no blood a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T15:11:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656386684","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:34:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4971900":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:53:26Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:53:25Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4971900":"2026-10-26T05:53:26Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4971900":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:53:25Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:53:25Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5108190":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:53:26Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:53:26Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4971900","app_id":4971900,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:12Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/Ge